# Route: guide 16 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 32 to 34, 53
# quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thunder Bluff, Mulgore, Undercity, Dustwallow Marsh, The Barrens):
# Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff
# -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder
# Bluff -> Skywatcher Plateau -> Undercity -> Brackenwall Village -> Witch
# Hill -> Theramore Isle -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen
# Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 6607 Nat Pagle,
# Angler Extreme.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), Compendium of the Fallen
# (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723), Leaders
# of the Fang (914), Compendium of the Fallen (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102),
